cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the paper below (preferred-citation) and,
  to point at the exact code version, this software archive.
type: software
title: "ifac_safeprocess_2027"
abstract: >-
  Code for the paper "Stage-based training of probabilistic neural networks for
  prognostics: an application to the NASA CMAPSS dataset", submitted to the
  IFAC SafeProcess 2027 conference. It compares joint and stage-based training
  of mean-variance estimation networks on the NASA C-MAPSS FD001 dataset, built
  on the stagereg library.
authors:
